  "slug": "special-winter-olympic-torchbearer",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/12234_special-winter-olympic-torchbearer.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "There is a special torchbearer in the 2022 Beijing Winter Olympics torch relay. His name is Luan Yushuai, a courier boy. Luan Yushuai comes from a rural area in Northeast China. He entered the logistics industry in 2015 and became a courier. Because of his diligence and hard work, he is able to deliver dozens more express delivery orders than others every day. In 2017, he ran a marathon for the first time. Since then, he has continued to run every day. Even when delivering express delivery, he trained with sandbags and weights, perfectly combining work and training. At last year's Beijing Half Marathon, he won first place among non-professional runners and was called \"the fastest courier boy\" by netizens. Luan Yushuai ran all the way, from the streets to the marathon, and now to the Winter Olympics, and his dream has become a reality. As an extraordinary ordinary person who has made outstanding contributions, he is also a representative of the majority of couriers."
  ],
  "english_full": "There is a special torchbearer in the 2022 Beijing Winter Olympics torch relay. His name is Luan Yushuai, a courier boy. Luan Yushuai comes from a rural area in Northeast China. He entered the logistics industry in 2015 and became a courier. Because of his diligence and hard work, he is able to deliver dozens more express delivery orders than others every day. In 2017, he ran a marathon for the first time. Since then, he has continued to run every day. Even when delivering express delivery, he trained with sandbags and weights, perfectly combining work and training. At last year's Beijing Half Marathon, he won first place among non-professional runners and was called \"the fastest courier boy\" by netizens. Luan Yushuai ran all the way, from the streets to the marathon, and now to the Winter Olympics, and his dream has become a reality. As an extraordinary ordinary person who has made outstanding contributions, he is also a representative of the majority of couriers.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "На эстафе́те факелов Олимпи́ады в Пе́кине 2022 года есть осо́бый фа́кельщик. Его и́мя — Луа́н Ю́шуа́й, он курье́р. Луа́н Ю́шуа́й при́ехал из се́льской пло́щади на севе́ре Кита́я. Он вошёл в логи́стику в 2015 году и стал курье́ром."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Na éstafete fakelov Olímpiady v Pekíne 2022 goda yest' osóbnýj fakel'shchik. Yego ímya — Luán Yúshuái, on kur'yer. Luán Yúshuái priéhal iz sél'skoy plóshchadi na sevér-Kitáya. On voshél v logístiku v 2015 godu i stal kur'yerom."
  ],
